{"conversation":"sochi","question":"Does it have a TACAN?","reply":{"answer":"In the DCS: Caucasus simulator, the Sochi-Adler airfield has an NDB with marker (CO) and an ILS on runway 06, but a TACAN is not listed in the simulator records for this airfield.","ids":["/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-caucasus/#af-sochi-adler"],"topic":["/encyclopedia/locations/sochi/"],"references":[{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-caucasus/#af-sochi-adler","title":"Sochi-Adler · DCS: Caucasus"}]},"ms":2162,"passed":true,"revision":"019e99d4c61b60d5a44c350656fa28e76dbad556"}
