{"conversation":"ramat","question":"What is the TACAN for Ramat David?","reply":{"answer":"In DCS: Sinai, the TACAN is VORTAC 84X, 113.7 MHz (RMD), and in DCS: Syria, the TACAN is VORTAC 84X, 113.7 MHz (RMD).","ids":["/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-sinai/#af-ramat-david","/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-syria/#af-ramat-david"],"topic":["/encyclopedia/locations/ramat-david/"],"references":[{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-sinai/#af-ramat-david","title":"Ramat David · DCS: Sinai"},{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-syria/#af-ramat-david","title":"Ramat David · DCS: Syria"}]},"ms":1355,"passed":true,"revision":"019e99d4c61b60d5a44c350656fa28e76dbad556"}
{"conversation":"ramat","question":"What runways are available?","reply":{"answer":"The available runways are 09/27, 11/29, and 15/33. In DCS: Sinai, the runways are 09/27 (6,877 ft), 11/29 (7,318 ft), and 15/33 (7,385 ft), while in DCS: Syria, they are 09/27 (7,443 ft), 11/29 (7,533 ft), and 33/15 (7,613 ft).","ids":["/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-sinai/#af-ramat-david","/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-syria/#af-ramat-david"],"topic":["/encyclopedia/locations/ramat-david/"],"references":[{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-sinai/#af-ramat-david","title":"Ramat David · DCS: Sinai"},{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-syria/#af-ramat-david","title":"Ramat David · DCS: Syria"}]},"ms":2767,"passed":true,"revision":"019e99d4c61b60d5a44c350656fa28e76dbad556"}
{"conversation":"ramat","question":"Which one runs east-west?","reply":{"answer":"None of the runways at Ramat David run east-west. In DCS: Sinai, the runway headings are 082°/262°, 103°/283°, and 140°/320°, while in DCS: Syria, the headings are 082°/262°, 103°/283°, and 320°/140°.","ids":["/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-sinai/#af-ramat-david","/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-syria/#af-ramat-david"],"topic":["/encyclopedia/locations/ramat-david/"],"references":[{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-sinai/#af-ramat-david","title":"Ramat David · DCS: Sinai"},{"id":"/encyclopedia/locations/dcs-syria/#af-ramat-david","title":"Ramat David · DCS: Syria"}]},"ms":2117,"passed":false,"revision":"019e99d4c61b60d5a44c350656fa28e76dbad556"}
