{"conversation":"comparison-follow-up","question":"What engines does the F-14B have?","reply":{"answer":"The F-14B is equipped with two General Electric F110-GE-400 afterburning turbofans, each providing 27,000 lb.","ids":["/encyclopedia/aircraft/f-14/","/encyclopedia/aircraft/f-14/#swing-wings-and-phoenix-missiles"],"topic":["/encyclopedia/aircraft/f-14/"],"references":[{"id":"/encyclopedia/aircraft/f-14/","title":"F-14 Tomcat"},{"id":"/encyclopedia/aircraft/f-14/#swing-wings-and-phoenix-missiles","title":"F-14 Tomcat · Swing wings and Phoenix missiles"}]},"ms":1175,"passed":true,"revision":"019e99d4c61b60d5a44c350656fa28e76dbad556"}
